import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 840 | Transcended Ones and Technology · Overview — The Transcended One's Technology System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 840 | Transcended Ones and Technology · Overview — The Transcended One's Technology System","no":840,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Technology","Technology System","Law Engineering","Open Sharing"],"related":["60-Technology-System Overview","68-Technology Ethics and Safety Boundaries","69-Technical Openness and Sharing Mechanism","761-Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Civilizational Engineering Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0840_模块4-超脱者与科技-总论.md","filePath":"en/0840_模块4-超脱者与科技-总论.md"}`),a={name:"en/0840_模块4-超脱者与科技-总论.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,u){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-840-transcended-ones-and-technology-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-technology-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 840 | Transcended Ones and Technology · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Technology System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-840-transcended-ones-and-technology-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-technology-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 840 | Transcended Ones and Technology · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Technology System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 60, 68, 69, 761</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-does-not-speak-by-fists-but-speaks-by-engineering" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one does not &quot;speak by fists,&quot; but &quot;speaks by engineering&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-does-not-speak-by-fists-but-speaks-by-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one does not &quot;speak by fists,&quot; but &quot;speaks by engineering&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old worldview, transcended one = ultimate combat power. He raises a hand to shatter stars; breathing forms calamities; technology? That is low-level civilization&#39;s toy; strong ones disdain it. Heng Yuan Zhou completely overturns this: <strong>the true transcended one is precisely the chief engineer who turns cultivation laws into engineering, technology, and popularization.</strong> His strength manifests not in &quot;how much I alone can fight,&quot; but in &quot;whether I can turn &#39;becoming stronger&#39; into public technology all Myriad Ranks may use.&quot; This entry is the &quot;Transcended Ones and Technology&quot; sub-theme overview, answering: what does the transcended one&#39;s technology system look like as a whole, and where lies its fundamental difference from predatory &quot;closed-door divine power.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires technology full-level open, not treating technology as private tool monopoly; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires technical results serve Myriad Ranks&#39; 99%, not making tools only for a few strong ones; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires technology&#39;s ultimate purpose be lifting Myriad Ranks together into uplift; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires R&amp;D proceed within the framework of isolation, supervision, and knowledge return; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the technology system itself be self-consistent — technology does not violate fundamental laws; the setting does not open &quot;black-tech&quot; back doors for the protagonist by plot convenience.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-technology-system-s-positioning-turning-enlightenment-into-engineering" tabindex="-1">I. The Technology System&#39;s Positioning: Turning &quot;Enlightenment&quot; into &quot;Engineering&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-technology-system-s-positioning-turning-enlightenment-into-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Technology System&#39;s Positioning: Turning &quot;Enlightenment&quot; into &quot;Engineering&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s cultivation is &quot;enlightenment&quot; — relying on personal comprehension, on the line between life and death, on unrepeatable adventures. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core leap is decomposing &quot;enlightenment&quot; into engineerable technical segments. Document 60 Technology-System Overview has already laid the foundation: cultivation is not mysticism; it has law mechanism, energy transformation, spatial structure; it may be scanned, encoded, reconstructed.</p><p>The transcended one&#39;s role in it is not &quot;the strongest cultivator,&quot; but <strong>the chief engineer pushing cultivation laws toward engineering</strong>:</p><ul><li>He discovers a law mechanism; not only comprehends it himself, but also makes it into replicable technology;</li><li>He validates a breakthrough path; not only walks it himself, but also makes it into a deducible, teachable system;</li><li>He creates a new capability; not only possesses it himself, but also turns it into infrastructure shared by Myriad Ranks.</li></ul><p>In one sentence: <strong>old-world strong ones &quot;make themselves stronger&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou transcended ones &quot;make Myriad Ranks stronger.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="ii-the-technology-system-s-three-pillars" tabindex="-1">II. The Technology System&#39;s Three Pillars <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-technology-system-s-three-pillars" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Technology System&#39;s Three Pillars&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Benchmarking the base documents, the transcended one&#39;s technology system is supported by three pillars:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Pillar</th><th>Technical Core</th><th>Fundamental Problem Solved</th><th>Corresponding Base</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Deduction pillar</td><td>Multiplication Fruit deduction engine (hundred-fold deduction amplification)</td><td>Make &quot;enlightenment&quot; accelerated, parallelizable, verifiable</td><td>Documents 61, 16</td></tr><tr><td>Spatial pillar</td><td>Replication Mirror + isolation space</td><td>Let experiments, archaeology, exploration proceed &quot;low-pollution&quot;</td><td>Documents 63, 64</td></tr><tr><td>Network pillar</td><td>Anchor hardware + Alaya Network + cross-plane communications</td><td>Let technical results circulate network-wide, supervised throughout</td><td>Documents 66, 67, 21</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three pillars combined: the deduction pillar is responsible for &quot;thinking clearly&quot;; the spatial pillar for &quot;trialing safely&quot;; the network pillar for &quot;spreading and holding.&quot; Any cultivation-technologization must simultaneously pass these three gates — unclear is no good, unsafe trial is no good, unable to spread or hold is also no good.</p><h2 id="iii-why-technology-must-be-hyper-multiverse" tabindex="-1">III. Why Technology Must Be &quot;Hyper-Multiverse&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-technology-must-be-hyper-multiverse" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why Technology Must Be &quot;Hyper-Multiverse&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Module 4&#39;s technology is not mortal technology, but <strong>hyper-multiverse-grade technology</strong> — it must act on the law layer, the consciousness layer, cross-plane; must serve the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s civilizational engineering. This means:</p><ul><li>It may weave new laws, create new cosmoses, not just build starships;</li><li>It may simulate an entire civilization&#39;s evolution in isolation space, not just run small experiments;</li><li>It may transmit law data packets cross-plane, not just emit electromagnetic waves.</li></ul><p>Hyper-multiverse technology is possible because Heng Yuan Zhou already understands &quot;cultivation&quot; itself as law engineering. This is entry 741 onward&#39;s &quot;hyper-multiverse-grade manuals&quot; converging with this entry&#39;s &quot;hyper-multiverse-grade technology&quot; — <strong>manuals are technology, technology is manuals.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-technology-ethics-the-stronger-the-technology-the-harder-the-constraint" tabindex="-1">IV. Technology Ethics: The Stronger the Technology, the Harder the Constraint <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-technology-ethics-the-stronger-the-technology-the-harder-the-constraint" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Technology Ethics: The Stronger the Technology, the Harder the Constraint&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The more powerful hyper-multiverse technology, the more severe its abuse&#39;s consequences. Heng Yuan Zhou from the start put hard constraints on the technology system (Document 68 Technology Ethics and Safety Boundaries):</p><ul><li><strong>Not used for predation</strong>: the deduction engine may not be used to deduce predatory paths or solutions harming others;</li><li><strong>Low-pollution</strong>: cross-plane research all goes through Replication Mirror + isolation space; only returns knowledge, does not disturb causality;</li><li><strong>Open sharing</strong>: all technology open through the Selfless Dao network-wide; no patent monopoly;</li><li><strong>Alaya supervision</strong>: high-risk experiments throughout leave traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision; anomalies auto-alert.</li></ul><p>The transcended one is not technology&#39;s &quot;master,&quot; but technology&#39;s &quot;warden&quot; — he must ensure the strongest tools always stay within the Myriad-Rank-republican framework.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: engineering and popularizing enlightenment lets one insight serve Myriad Ranks for ten-thousand years, eliminating &quot;strong one dies technology zeroed&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: technology opens network-wide; ethics redlines seal &quot;using technology to predate&quot;; technology does not become the strong ones&#39; private tool</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s power relies on Gu Chensha&#39;s grace; no engineering, no popularization, ordinary people cannot use it; Heng Yuan Zhou makes &quot;becoming stronger&quot; into Myriad Ranks&#39; shared technological infrastructure</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: deduction engine, isolation space, anchor network open to all Myriad-Rank life forms, adapted per five lineages</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: technical documents, ethics boundaries, deployment parameters all public; part of the &quot;basic manuals → Sacrifice Dao → multiverse-grade → Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot; full-open chain&#39;s technical segment</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-technology-posts-civilizational-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Technology Posts&#39; Civilizational Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-technology-posts-civilizational-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Technology Posts&#39; Civilizational Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s technology contributions are likewise metered as civilizational weight. If a technology may broadly benefit Myriad Ranks, lower cultivation cost, eliminate danger, its weight is high; a technology only making tools for a few strong ones has low weight. This set of metering turns &quot;whom technology serves&quot; from a moral slogan into an assessable hard metric. It prevents the transcended one from wasting ingenuity on divine artifacts that make himself &quot;more invincible,&quot; and steers power toward public infrastructure that &quot;makes Myriad Ranks stronger.&quot; The more advanced technology, the more critical this steering — because only technology calibrated by civilizational weight will not become a double-edged sword hanging over Myriad Ranks&#39; heads.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s technology system is the engineering realization of &quot;making Myriad Ranks stronger.&quot; It uses deduction, spatial, network three pillars to turn unrepeatable enlightenment into popularizable public technology; uses ethics redlines and Alaya supervision to lock the strongest tools within the Myriad-Rank-republican framework. When the transcended one is no longer &quot;the strongest fighter,&quot; but &quot;the chief engineer best at building roads,&quot; cultivation civilization truly moves from &quot;individual hero&quot; toward &quot;Myriad Ranks jointly building.&quot;</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/60-技术体系总览.html">Entry 60 · Technology-System Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/68-技术伦理与安全边界.html">Entry 68 · Technology Ethics and Safety Boundaries</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/69-技术开放与共享机制.html">Entry 69 · Technical Openness and Sharing Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/761_模块4-超多元级文明工程总论.html">Entry 761 · Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Civilizational Engineering Overview</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,y as default};
